 "not_at_mouser": {
  "LM3080": "LM3080 / CA3080 OTA: obsolete, not stocked at Mouser. Prism Circuits sells CA3080; otherwise buy from synth-parts suppliers.",
  "LM307": "LM307 op-amp: obsolete, not stocked at Mouser (LM301A also discontinued). Use new-old stock.",
  "PCB": "PCB from Elby Designs.",
  "RLED": "LED resistor: value depends on your LED; the Mouser file uses 1k.",
  "CA3046": "CA3046 / CA3086 transistor array: obsolete, not at Mouser. Low-Gain sells the LGE3086 drop-in replacement.",
  "Header": "0.1in right-angle header strip: cut from any breakaway header.",
  "Vactrol": "VTL5C3/2 vactrol: obsolete, not at Mouser. Synth-parts suppliers sell Xvive VTL5C3/2 replacements.",
  "Panel": "Front-panel hardware (jacks, knobs, rotary switch): buy to match your panel; see the panel hardware list on the module page.",
  "Submodule": "Separate sub-board: its parts are in this module's other upload file(s), with quantities already multiplied.",
  "See text": "Value depends on the build; see Ken Stone's construction notes before choosing it."
