 "notes": {
  "R:600k": "Ken Stone lists 600k, which is not a standard value; 604k is the nearest 1% (E96) value.",
  "T:4k7": "4k7 trimmers are not made; a 5k trimmer covers the same range. On 2026-11-21 the usual 3362P-1-502LF was out of stock at Mouser, so the file uses the 3362P-1-502TLF (same trimmer, different packing).",
  "C:1uF BP": "Nichicon lists this part as end of life (in stock on 2026-11-21). A 1uF film capacitor with 5 mm pitch also works if it fits.",
  "S:4066": "Ken Stone's 4016 is replaced by the pin-compatible CD4066BE (the 4016 is no longer made).",
  "S:CA3140": "Ken Stone's parts list allows a CA3140 in place of the LF356. Mouser had little stock on 2026-11-21 (82 pieces).",
  "S:2N3904": "Also used for the obsolete NPN numbers 2N3391A, 2N3565, 2N3566: same TO-92 EBC pinout; check the PCB overlay.",
  "S:2N3906": "Also used for the obsolete PNP numbers 2N3638, 2N4248, 2N4250, PN4250: same TO-92 EBC pinout; check the PCB overlay.",
  "M:SPDT": "Also used where an SPST switch is listed (leave one outer lug unconnected).",
  "R:910k": "Mouser does not stock the Yageo 910k; 909k is the nearest 1% (E96) value.",
  "R:2M2": "1% metal film in this value is not stocked at Mouser; 5% carbon film is fine here.",
  "R:2M7": "1% metal film in this value is not stocked at Mouser; 5% carbon film is fine here.",
  "R:3M3": "1% metal film in this value is not stocked at Mouser; 5% carbon film is fine here.",
  "R:4M7": "1% metal film in this value is not stocked at Mouser; 5% carbon film is fine here.",
  "R:6M8": "1% metal film in this value is not stocked at Mouser; 5% carbon film is fine here.",
  "C:1uF": "The Panasonic ECE-A1HKA010 is obsolete; the KEMET ESK is the same 1uF 50V radial electrolytic.",
  "S:LM324": "TI's LM324N was out of stock on 2026-11-21; the LM324AN is the same pinout with tighter offset.",
  "P:50k log": "Alpha's solder-lug log pot (313-5000F-50K) is not listed at Mouser; this one has the same 16 mm body and round shaft. Tayda's A-2399 is cheaper (see the Tayda list).",
  "C:82pF": "TDK marks this capacitor 'not recommended for new designs'; it was in stock on 2026-11-21.",
  "C:120pF": "TDK marks this capacitor 'not recommended for new designs'; it was in stock on 2026-11-21.",
